{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53870","headline":"登天姥 · 李敬方","name":"登天姥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天姥三重岭，危途遶峻溪。\n水喧无昼夜，云暗失东西。\n问路音难辨，通樵迹易迷。\n依稀日将午，何处一声鷄？\n（见孔延之《会稽掇英总集》卷四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李敬方","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53870.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53870","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}